title: Box3B
---
// Talk target of his moving box in 3B (Hotspots layer). See drawers_3b.yarn.
-> Leave the blush socks in the box <<if $chapter == "R1MoveIn" and $gate_r1_move_box and $item_blush_socks>>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "box">>
    <<set $r1_movein_socks to "refuse">>
    <<set $gate_r1_move_socks to true>>
    You: Under the cables. Where I won't see them.
    <<if $gate_r1_move_rules>>
        <<note r1_move "Unpacked. Bed.">>
    <<else>>
        <<note r1_move "Answer the door.">>
    <<endif>>
-> Put the blush socks on <<if (($chapter == "R1Sunday" and not $gate_r1_sun_croissant) or ($chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_door)) and $r1_socks_at == "box">>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "feet">>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Take the blush socks <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_door and $r1_socks_at == "box">>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "">>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to true>>
-> Look
    <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_door and $r1_socks_at == "box">>
        You: Under the cables. Where I put them so I'd stop seeing them.
        <<set $r1_thu2_socks_noted to true>>
        <<note thu2_socks "The socks?">>
    <<elseif $chapter == "R1Viewing">>
        You: The last tenant's boxes. Or the next one's.
    <<else>>
        You: Cables. Chargers for phones I don't own anymore.
    <<endif>>
===
